2UzBmRjlxc2o2UEhIZW5KQnYxb2F6Qkc5NFdvTWpTak9tZTdNMDhkUlNOLVVxbVpJUmJLUm92aDVIcTJkbzNycjhJN2V0LTlmM1M4RmpfM25WWXN0a0tFM0VFck1iWGNZT1o2UXNObUVXcS1UMmlqaG9welRqTVNVeWtveHdVUnJxbXZyQlFfLTdUNzBYVDJUb19FSjlHcQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Intuitive Machines 股票上漲：發生了什麼事？"},{"title":"Intuitive Machines Inc (Derivatives) Price (LUNR/USD) Today | Live Price, Market Cap & Chart","src":"Binance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE4zRWJPZER0bHJuX2lQZXhkTDAxVWREZmZjbVRqcVBXcUVBT09mek9kbmY0UmRmOEg0dlFwSC03LVdUZmZXSjBRZWUxb3drcEFXdkRKS3lncE9ZNWxzVkdPUHZ6SWRpYUc5cnZpY1M3UGFkTmV2Q1E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Intuitive Machines Inc（衍生性商品）今日價格（LUNR/美元） |即時價格、市值和圖表"}],"themes":[{"name":"國防/軍工","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1844452/000162828026019865/lunr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Intuitive Machines, Inc., collectively with its subsidiaries (the \"Company,\" \"IM,\" \"Intuitive Machines,\" \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our\") is a space infrastructure and services company founded in 2013 and focused on enabling sustained infrastructure and human activity beyond Earth. We believe the United States is transitioning from episodic space missions to long-duration operations and persistent presence, and we are building the systems and services required to support this evolution across civil, national security, and commercial markets.","zh":"Intuitive Machines, Inc. 及其子公司（「本公司」、「IM」、「Intuitive Machines」、「我們」或「我們的」）是一家太空基礎設施和服務公司，成立於 2013 年，專注於在地球以外實現可持續的基礎設施和人類活動。我們相信，美國正在從間歇性太空任務過渡到長期行動和持續存在，我們正在建立支援民用、國家安全和商業市場這一演變所需的系統和服務。"},{"en":"We build spacecraft, connect space-based networks, and operate infrastructure as-a-service that support operations across low Earth orbit (\"LEO\"), geostationary orbit (\"GEO\"), cislunar space, and deep-space. Our strategy is to evolve space activity from single-mission execution toward continuously operating infrastructure by combining spacecraft delivery with network connectivity and long-term operations. We believe this approach positions us to support enduring government requirements while enabling the development of a commercial space economy.","zh":"我們建造太空船、連接天基網路並運作基礎設施即服務，以支援低地球軌道（「LEO」）、地球靜止軌道（「GEO」）、月地空間和深空的運作。我們的策略是透過將太空船交付與網路連接和長期營運相結合，將太空活動從單一任務執行發展為持續營運的基礎設施。我們相信，這種方法使我們能夠支持政府的持久要求，同時促進商業太空經濟的發展。"},{"en":"On September 16, 2022, Inflection Point Acquisition Corp. (\"IPAX\") entered into a business combination agreement with Intuitive Machines, LLC. On February 10, 2023, IPAX domesticated into a Delaware corporation and changed its name to \"Intuitive Machines, Inc.\" in connection with the domestication, Intuitive Machines, Inc. became a holding company whose principal assets are the Intuitive Machines, LLC Common Units.","zh":"2022 年 9 月 16 日，Inflection Point Acquisition Corp.（「IPAX」）與 Intuitive Machines, LLC 簽訂了業務合併協議。 2023 年 2 月 10 日，IPAX 歸化為特拉華州公司，並更名為「Intuitive Machines, Inc.」。在馴化過程中，Intuitive Machines, Inc. 成為一家控股公司，其主要資產為 Intuitive Machines, LLC 的普通單位。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We are an integral partner to our customers and partners. We execute on our commitments and develop end-to-end mission solutions for our commercial, civil and national security customers.","zh":"我們是客戶和合作夥伴不可或缺的合作夥伴。我們履行承諾，為商業、民用和國家安全客戶開發端到端任務解決方案。"},{"en":"NASA. We are partnered with and service NASA by building power and propulsion spacecraft, connected data services, operating mobility infrastructure, lunar cargo delivery and other Artemis-related contracts. In 2019, NASA awarded us a contract to develop and construct the power and propulsion element for the agency's lunar Gateway (the contract was awarded to Lanteris prior to the consummation of the Lanteris acquisition (as further discussed herein)). Through strategic acquisition, Intuitive Machines is providing advanced deep-space navigation services for multiple NASA Artemis-related missions. We are one of two awardees for NASA's Near Space Network Direct-to-Earth data services to the lunar vicinity (1.2) and beyond the lunar vicinity (1.3). We are also the sole awardee for the Near Space Network's data relay services (2.2), which will provide a constellation of satellites around the","zh":"美國太空總署。我們與 NASA 合作並為 NASA 提供服務，包括建造動力和推進太空船、互聯數據服務、營運行動基礎設施、月球貨物運輸和其他與 Artemis 相關的合約。 2019 年，NASA 授予我們一份合同，為該機構的月球門戶開發和建造動力和推進元件（該合約在完成 Lanteris 收購之前授予了 Lanteris（如本文進一步討論））。透過策略性收購，Intuitive Machines 正在為多個 NASA Artemis 相關任務提供先進的深空導航服務。我們是美國太空總署近地網路直接對地資料服務的兩個獲獎者之一，該服務涵蓋月球附近地區 (1.2) 和月球附近地區 (1.3)。我們也是近太空網路資料中繼服務（2.2）的唯一獲獎者，該服務將提供圍繞太空的衛星群"}],"competition":[],"segments":{},"peers":["RDW","PL","ASTS","RKLB","FLY"]}}